                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a55cbfb6-2fa1-3bc2-a922-b91344641ec2",
                        "entry_id": "dac517a9-3aca-3ccd-9f40-d2fc5bb0b041",
                        "glosses": [
                            "anticonstitutional, unconstitutional"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0339e212-13bf-4dd7-9a9e-39a27e61942c",
                                "sense_id": "a55cbfb6-2fa1-3bc2-a922-b91344641ec2",
                                "text": "Ука́з никому́ не показа́лся ни антиконституцио́нным, ни экстреми́стским. Верхо́вный Сове́т сам сде́лал сто́лько антиконституцио́нных шаго́в, что противостоя́ние с президе́нтом дости́гло апоге́я.",
                                "translation": "The decree didn't seem to anyone neither anticonstitutional nor extremist. The Supreme Council themselves made so many anticonstitutional moves that their confrontation reached its apogee.",
                                "english": "The decree didn't seem to anyone neither anticonstitutional nor extremist. The Supreme Council themselves made so many anticonstitutional moves that their confrontation reached its apogee."
                            }
                        ]
